[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5820.55, "timestamp": "01:37:00", "text": "我们不。这没关系。对，就是这个人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5823.109, "timestamp": "01:37:03", "text": "必须是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5826.629, "timestamp": "01:37:06", "text": "即将上线的直播已准备就绪。哦。哦，是的。我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5829.35, "timestamp": "01:37:09", "text": "现在所有东西都搬走了。好的。好的。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5830.87, "timestamp": "01:37:10", "text": "是的。是的。这样应该就足够了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5834.229, "timestamp": "01:37:14", "text": "我觉得这应该可行。我们开始吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5838.709, "timestamp": "01:37:18", "text": "把它发送到主地图，看看效果如何。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5841.109, "timestamp": "01:37:21", "text": "看起来会是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5879.75, "timestamp": "01:37:59", "text": "不。哪里有？"}]